00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:27.227 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'ai hâte de rencontrerma nou.

00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:28.295 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais le manque d'enseignants

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:29.363 size:53% position:73% line:53%
