00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.465 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le matin de la rentrée,

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.532 size:53% position:73% line:53%
400 postes à temps plein

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:33.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
