00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.648 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Tout le monde a minimalement

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.716 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un adulte devant la classe.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.751 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Puis là, actuelle

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.818 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on se sert de notre banque

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.886 size:53% position:73% line:53%
