00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:16.410 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CATHERINE BEAUVAIS-ST-PIERRE,

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.477 size:53% position:73% line:53%
prés. Alliance prof. de Montréal

00:01:15.709 --> 00:01:18.545 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On est en mode solution pour

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
