00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:41.635 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Bonne journée d'école

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:42.702 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les amis!

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.770 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Près de 600 postes

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:44.838 size:53% position:73% line:53%
